Cell["\<\
Twelve codes over the two-state three-symbol automata, each evolved from the \
same seed:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->258128750,ExpressionUUID->"88516cfd-ef84-49bc-bec3-9072fc7130d3"],

